{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grandis Adventures</strong> is a seamless urban exploration action RPG set in a futuristic city.<br>In this demo, you can experience three distinct scenes \u2014 the <strong>City</strong>, the <strong>Underground</strong>, and <strong>Space</strong> \u2014 each offering a different style of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Areas:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City District (urban area)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underground Facility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbital (space) area</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City: conversations, walking, and ambient exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underground: quest-like short missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space: action-focused gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic combat, item preview, and light interactions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime:</strong> 20\u201340 minutes (depending on playstyle)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not Included in the Demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save/load functionality (progress will reset each session)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced skills, vehicles, and larger world areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full storyline or long quests</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned Features for the Full Version:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive open world spanning multiple districts and orbital zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep combat, progression, vehicles, and living NPC schedules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multilingual support and accessibility settings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing. Your feedback is greatly appreciated.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548730?t=1760885672","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548730/6f03cb5c448c856346131c81803ab0652b1a7a3c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760885672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548730/70d357480b3659fcab5c370233886bc8b41fd4c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760885672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548730/70d357480b3659fcab5c370233886bc8b41fd4c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760885672","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grandis Adventures</strong> is a seamless urban exploration action RPG set in a futuristic city.<br>In this demo, you can experience three distinct scenes \u2014 the <strong>City</strong>, the <strong>Underground</strong>, and <strong>Space</strong> \u2014 each offering a different style of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Areas:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City District (urban area)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underground Facility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbital (space) area</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City: conversations, walking, and ambient exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underground: quest-like short missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space: action-focused gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic combat, item preview, and light interactions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime:</strong> 20\u201340 minutes (depending on playstyle)</p><p class=